          "snippet": {
            "line": 444,
            "text": "theorem finite_jet_bound (lam a b : ℝ) (hab : a < b) (N : ℕ) :\n    ∃ K : ℝ, 0 ≤ K ∧ ∀ (C : ℝ) (k : ℕ), k ≤ N → ∀ (d e : Debt) (R : ℝ),\n      |iteratedDeriv k (deltaV lam C a b d) R - iteratedDeriv k (deltaV lam C a b e) R| +\n      |iteratedDeriv k (gamma lam C a b d) R - iteratedDeriv k (gamma lam C a b e) R| ≤\n        K * ‖C⁻¹‖ * ‖d - e‖"
          }
        }
      }
    }
